  "tensions": [
    "If Zebra is infinite (God), how can there be contesting forces and mistakes in the cosmic system?",
    "If PKD is now trans-human/2000-year-old, is his current personality 'fake' or 'real'?",
    "Why wasn't anyone else's personality wiped out? Why only PKD?",
    "Normal cosmic processes supposedly shape us through engramming, but this is called non-intervention; divine intervention is different. But aren't both operating on humans?",
    "PKD claims he didn't know he was embedding prophecy in Tears, yet also claims he sensed demonic forces trying to stop it. How reconcile conscious sensing with unconscious embedding?",
    "Is PKD's mission redemptive or strategic (bait in a trap)? He wavers between these framings."
  ],
  "evidence_quotes": [
    "We are programmed in a regular way - I was in 3-74, de-or counter programmed against dosm what must be a/the regular programming. In effect it was an interruption, an override, of the normal.",
    "I think we are now in the \"herald angel\" period. \"Hark! I tell you good tidings of great joy that will be to all men\" etc... we did/do not know by faith but by direct experience (as in 3-74).",
    "Although objects are influenced, it is we who are most influenced. We are caused to selectively learn; this is a continuation the process of teaching which I saw acting in early childhood.",
    "it was my entire engrammed self - trained by the systems meationed on these preceding pages - which was destraged just before 3-74 + replaced by another non¬ engramned or differently engranual one... that personality evidently didn't just die; it was deliberately wiped out, + replaced by another.",
    "I believe it to have been the Parousia. The pre-incaration: defeat of the gentile world power"
  ],
  "uncertainty_flags": [
    "The 'Xerox letter' is never explained or contextualized--unclear what it was or why PKD needed saving from responding to it",
