    "PKD claims his old personality had 2000-year-old memories, but this may be a metaphor or confusion about what memories mean across reincarnation",
    "The claim that Zebra 'doesn't err' conflicts with the earlier statement that a 'mistake was made + corrected' in the programming system",
    "PKD attributes unconscious authorship of prophecy to Tears but provides no textual evidence from the novel itself in this entry",
    "The reference to Rome c. AD 70 and Christ's presence there needs clarification--is this literal, mystical, or historical?"
  ],
  "reading_excerpt": "Although objects are influenced, it is we who are most influenced. We are caused to selectively learn; this is a continuation the process of teaching which I saw acting in early childhood.",
